WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.383
Okay, so technically, this never happened to me,

2
00:00:02.423 --> 00:00:06.369
because generally, when you’re having an interview,

3
00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:09.033
the recruiter is trying to get the best out of you,

4
00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:11.636
so they are giving you, like, the space

5
00:00:11.676 --> 00:00:15.291
so you can express yourself and explain your ideas.

6
00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.107
However, if this happens to you, what I recommend

7
00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:21.900
is to first let them finish their sentence,

8
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:24.594
and then you can say something like:

9
00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:27.819
“Yes, I understand… just to finish my points.”

10
00:00:27.859 --> 00:00:31.963
And then you can finish explaining your points, and that’s it.
